{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "version": "1.0",
  "strings": {
    "Bank account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bankkonto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Broker account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Depot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Real estate": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Immobilie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Debt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schulden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Privacy": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Datenschutz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your accounts, balances and notes are stored only on this iPhone. Tally has no servers, no account to sign into, and no analytics or crash-reporting of any kind. Nothing you type is ever uploaded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Konten, Kontostände und Notizen liegen ausschliesslich auf diesem iPhone. Tally hat keine Server, kein Benutzerkonto und keinerlei Analyse- oder Absturzberichte. Nichts, was du eingibst, wird jemals hochgeladen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The one thing Tally downloads is the European Central Bank's public exchange-rate file, so it can convert currencies. That request carries no identifier and says nothing about you or your accounts — it is the same file anyone can open in a browser.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Einzige, was Tally herunterlädt, ist die öffentliche Wechselkursdatei der Europäischen Zentralbank, um Währungen umzurechnen. Diese Anfrage enthält keine Kennung und verrät nichts über dich oder deine Konten — es ist dieselbe Datei, die jede und jeder im Browser öffnen kann."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your data is included in your normal encrypted iPhone backup, which is how it survives a lost or replaced phone. There is no separate Tally cloud.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Daten sind Teil des normalen verschlüsselten iPhone-Backups — so überstehen sie ein verlorenes oder ersetztes Gerät. Eine eigene Tally-Cloud gibt es nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working offline": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ohne Verbindung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tally works with no connection at all. It uses the last rates it downloaded and tells you the date they came from. If a day has no rate, that day is left off the chart rather than estimated.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tally funktioniert ganz ohne Verbindung. Es rechnet mit den zuletzt geladenen Kursen und zeigt dir, von wann sie stammen. Fehlt für einen Tag ein Kurs, bleibt dieser Tag im Diagramm weg, statt geschätzt zu werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rate source": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kursquelle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "European Central Bank": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Europäische Zentralbank"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updated %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktualisiert %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "History": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verlauf"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a balance": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kontostand erfassen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unarchive": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus dem Archiv holen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archive": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archivieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konto löschen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archiving keeps this account's past on the chart. Deleting removes it from history entirely.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim Archivieren bleibt die Vergangenheit dieses Kontos im Diagramm. Beim Löschen verschwindet sie vollständig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bearbeiten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete account and its history": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konto und Verlauf löschen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abbrechen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This rewrites your net worth history as though the account never existed. Archiving instead keeps the past intact.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das schreibt deinen Vermögensverlauf so um, als hätte es das Konto nie gegeben. Archivieren lässt die Vergangenheit unangetastet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show in %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %@ anzeigen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This account has no balances yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für dieses Konto gibt es noch keine Kontostände."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Art"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Currency": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Währung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter what you owe as a positive number. Tally subtracts it from your net worth.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib deine Schuld als positive Zahl ein. Tally zieht sie vom Vermögen ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opening balance (optional)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anfangsstand (optional)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved as today's balance. You can backfill older figures afterwards.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird als heutiger Stand gesichert. Ältere Werte kannst du danach nachtragen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notizen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sichern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update all balances": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle Kontostände aktualisieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steps through every account with last month's figures pre-filled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Führt dich durch alle Konten, mit den Werten vom letzten Mal vorausgefüllt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accounts": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add your first account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erstes Konto hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archived": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archiviert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archived accounts stay on the chart for the period they existed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archivierte Konten bleiben für den Zeitraum im Diagramm, in dem es sie gab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konto hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amount in %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Betrag in %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An entry's date can't be changed. Delete it and add another to move it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Datum eines Eintrags lässt sich nicht ändern. Lösche ihn und erfasse einen neuen, um ihn zu verschieben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This replaces the balance already recorded for that day.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ersetzt den bereits für diesen Tag erfassten Stand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only a bank account can hold a negative balance. Debts are entered as positive amounts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur ein Bankkonto kann negativ sein. Schulden werden als positive Beträge erfasst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gesamt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By type": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach Art"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Per account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro Konto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chart": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagramm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No balances yet": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch keine Kontostände"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add an account and enter what it's worth. The chart starts from your first entry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Füge ein Konto hinzu und trage seinen Wert ein. Das Diagramm beginnt bei deinem ersten Eintrag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some days can't be shown": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einige Tage lassen sich nicht anzeigen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld day](inflect: true) have no exchange rate for %@, so they're left off the chart rather than estimated.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für %lld Tage fehlt der Wechselkurs für %@ — sie bleiben im Diagramm weg, statt geschätzt zu werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download rates": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kurse laden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Portfolio currency": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Portfoliowährung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose your currency": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle deine Währung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every account is converted into this currency for the total. You can change it later without losing any history.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für die Gesamtsumme wird jedes Konto in diese Währung umgerechnet. Du kannst sie später ändern, ohne Verlauf zu verlieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your balances stay on this iPhone. Tally has no account to sign into and never uploads your data — the only thing it downloads is the European Central Bank's public exchange-rate file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Kontostände bleiben auf diesem iPhone. Tally hat kein Benutzerkonto und lädt deine Daten nie hoch — heruntergeladen wird einzig die öffentliche Wechselkursdatei der Europäischen Zentralbank."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loslegen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tally is locked": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tally ist gesperrt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entsperren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock Tally to see your balances.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entsperre Tally, um deine Kontostände zu sehen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tally can't open your data": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tally kann deine Daten nicht öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your accounts and balances have not been deleted. They are still on this iPhone, and nothing on this screen will change or remove them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Konten und Kontostände wurden nicht gelöscht. Sie sind weiterhin auf diesem iPhone, und nichts auf diesem Bildschirm ändert oder entfernt sie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please don't delete the app to fix this — that would delete your data with it. Updating Tally from the App Store, or restarting your iPhone, may help.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bitte lösche die App nicht, um das zu beheben — damit würdest du auch deine Daten löschen. Ein Update von Tally aus dem App Store oder ein Neustart deines iPhone kann helfen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erneut versuchen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technical details": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Technische Details"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tally doesn't send error reports. These details stay on your iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tally sendet keine Fehlerberichte. Diese Angaben bleiben auf deinem iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Net worth": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vermögen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einstellungen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changing this re-converts your whole history using the rates that applied on each day. Nothing is lost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das rechnet deinen gesamten Verlauf neu um, mit den Kursen des jeweiligen Tages. Es geht nichts verloren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Require Face ID or passcode": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Face ID oder Code verlangen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locks Tally when you leave it, and hides your balances in the app switcher.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sperrt Tally, sobald du es verlässt, und verbirgt deine Kontostände in der App-Übersicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set a passcode on this iPhone to use this.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Richte auf diesem iPhone einen Code ein, um das zu nutzen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exchange rates": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wechselkurse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rates as of": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kurse vom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
